{
  "declaredLength": 4844,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens, c’est <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690065006E0073002C0020006320190065007300740020001000020100000000200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On peut plus être tranquilles en famille, faut\ntoujours qu’on vienne nous enquiquiner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais qu’est-ce que tu racontes ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020007100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500650020007400750020007200610063006F006E0074006500730020003F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl n’y en a que pour <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Moi aussi,\nj’ai... j’ai quelque chose à dire à Narica !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais avant tout, je voudrais vous défier,\nles Digi-Z4P !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006100760061006E007400200074006F00750074002C0020006A006500200076006F00750064007200610069007300200076006F007500730020006400E90066006900650072002C000A006C0065007300200044006900670069002D005A0034005000200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, c’est pas une mauvaise idée !\nT’en penses quoi, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C002000632019006500730074002000700061007300200075006E00650020006D006100750076006100690073006500200069006400E9006500200021000A005420190065006E002000700065006E007300650073002000710075006F0069002C002000100002010000000020003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça me va !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006D0065002000760061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une prochaine fois...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0065002000700072006F0063006800610069006E006500200066006F00690073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’habitude, tu acceptes, mais je suppose que\nparfois, tu n’es pas d’humeur à te battre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec Baggaïd et mon équipe, on a une chance\nde gagner... Non ! On VA gagner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’peux pas refuser un combat contre\nmes Narickers !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019007000650075007800200070006100730020007200650066007500730065007200200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200063006F006E007400720065000A006D006500730020004E0061007200690063006B00650072007300200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comme j’incarne Narica pendant les Nari-Quiz,\nc’est comme si vous alliez affronter DEUX Narica !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez un instant...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640065007A00200075006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi, tu te dégonfles ?!\nAllez, bats-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F0069002C0020007400750020007400650020006400E90067006F006E0066006C006500730020003F0021000A0041006C006C0065007A002C00200062006100740073002D0074006F006900200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estimez-vous heureux de pouvoir m’affronter !\nPar contre, on joue pour la « win » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vas te décider, oui ou non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200076006100730020007400650020006400E900630069006400650072002C0020006F007500690020006F00750020006E006F006E0020003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si on gagne, vous devrez nous aider à préparer\ndes p’tits Pains Narica !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Décide-toi vite, j’ai hâte de commencer\nce combat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E90063006900640065002D0074006F006900200076006900740065002C0020006A2019006100690020006800E20074006500200064006500200063006F006D006D0065006E006300650072000A0063006500200063006F006D006200610074002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ohmassacre, méga-évolue !\nFull boost en puissance !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068006D0061007300730061006300720065002C0020006D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C0075006500200021000A00460075006C006C00200062006F006F0073007400200065006E0020007000750069007300730061006E0063006500200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Minotaupe ! Méga-évolue, mon grand !\nMontre-leur de quel bois on s’chauffe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Baggaïd ! Méga-évolue et montre-nous\ntoute l’étendue de tes capacités !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a gagné !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E002000610020006700610067006E00E900200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, toi ! Tu voulais pas m’dire un truc ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C00200074006F00690020002100200054007500200076006F0075006C00610069007300200070006100730020006D2019006400690072006500200075006E002000740072007500630020003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En fait, j’ai envie de créer une tenue pour toi,\net je voudrais qu’un jour, tu la portes !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, j’veux bien !\nMais le design a intérêt à me plaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002C0020006A201900760065007500780020006200690065006E00200021000A004D0061006900730020006C0065002000640065007300690067006E0020006100200069006E007400E9007200EA0074002000E00020006D006500200070006C006100690072006500200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est une bonne idée ! Moi aussi, j’en veux une !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi j’veux incarner Narica à la perfection,\nautant que je m’habille comme elle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ÇA VA PAS, LA TÊTE ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700410020005600410020005000410053002C0020004C00410020005400CA005400450020003F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nAttrape ça.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C0020001000020100000000200021000A0041007400740072006100700065002000E70061002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez le survêtement de Narica !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A0020006C00650020007300750072007600EA00740065006D0065006E00740020006400650020004E00610072006900630061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et pour toi, un Pain Narica de mon grand-père.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200070006F0075007200200074006F0069002C00200075006E0020005000610069006E0020004E006100720069006300610020006400650020006D006F006E0020006700720061006E0064002D007000E800720065002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, un Pain Narica...\nJe le chérirai comme la prunelle de mes yeux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200075006E0020005000610069006E0020004E00610072006900630061002E002E002E000A004A00650020006C006500200063006800E90072006900720061006900200063006F006D006D00650020006C00610020007000720075006E0065006C006C00650020006400650020006D006500730020007900650075007800200021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... J’te conseille plutôt de le manger, ouais !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004A20190074006500200063006F006E007300650069006C006C006500200070006C0075007400F400740020006400650020006C00650020006D0061006E006700650072002C0020006F007500610069007300200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai quand même le seum d’avoir perdu, alors que\nj’avais bien entraîné Ohmassacre et mon équipe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les p’tits Pains Narica ont un succès fou !\nOn va p’têt’ en vendre dans toute la région !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est important de dire ce qu’on a sur le cœur.\nJe n’y arrive pas encore, mais un jour, peut-être...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    }
  ],
